# 02_differentiation.rw: derivatives with the rule set All
INC "inc/all"

REWR D(x^3 + 2*x, x) : All
REWR D(sin(x)^2, x) : All
REWR D(x^2*exp(-x), x) : All
REWR D(ln(sin(x)), x) : All
REWR D(arctan(2*x), x) : All

"---- a second derivative"
REWR D(D(x^4*cos(x), x), x) : All

"---- D(f,x) does not assume that other symbols are constant (D(y,x) stays);"
"---- deriv(f,x) does: a partial derivative"
SYM kk : real
REWR deriv(x^2*y + y^3, y) : All
REWR deriv(kk*x^2 + sin(kk*x), x) : All
